  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contributing to the Decrease of Mortality and Morbidity related to Malaria in Guinea-Bissau - Guinea-Bissau (01-Jan-2024-31-Dec-2026)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Guinea-Bissau, Malaria, United Nations Development Programme (UNDP Guinea-Bissau)This program has the following goals: R&#xe9;duire le fardeau du paludisme  Reduce malaria burden. The objectives of this program are: R&#xe9;duire le taux de mortalit&#xe9; due au paludisme d&apos;au moins 75% en 2030 par rapport &#xe0; 2015  Reduce malaria mortality rate at least 75% by 2030 in relation to 2015.  R&#xe9;duire le taux de morbidit&#xe9; palustre d&apos;au moins 75% en 2030 par rapport &#xe0; 2015  Reduce malaria morbidity rate at least 75% by 2030 in relation to 2015.  Renforcer la capacit&#xe9; de gestion du programme &#xe0; tous les niveaux  Strenghten capacity for program management at all levels</narrative>
  </description>
